    {
      "wpId": 50473,
      "title": "My Correlation Matrices: Stock Correlation",
      "duration": "Reading",
      "type": "text",
      "vimeoId": null,
      "contentHtml": "<p>The table shows the correlation coefficients between the SPDR S&amp;P 500 ETF (SPY) and a selection of 40 individual securities from various sectors. The correlation values range from 0.510 to 1.637, indicating how each security's price movements are related to the broader U.S. equity market represented by SPY.</p>\n<p>A correlation close to 1 suggests a strong positive relationship with SPY, meaning the security tends to move in the same direction as the overall market. Higher correlations, such as those for AAL (1.314) and AMZN (1.510), indicate that these stocks have historically moved more closely in line with SPY. In contrast, lower correlations, such as CVS (0.510), suggest a weaker connection to SPY, implying a more diversified or independent price movement relative to the broader market.</p>\n<p>This table provides insight into how different stocks are expected to perform in relation to the market, aiding in portfolio diversification and risk management decisions.</p>\n<table style=\"width: 366px\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 149.812px;text-align: left\">Security</th>\n<th style=\"width: 206.188px;text-align: left\">SPY Correlation</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 149.812px\">SPY</td>\n<td style=\"width: 206.188px\">1.000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 149.812px\">AAL</td>\n<td style=\"width: 206.188px\">1.314</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 149.812px\">AAPL</td>\n<td style=\"width: 206.188px\">1.206</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 149.812px\">AIG</td>\n<td style=\"width: 206.188px\">0.852</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 149.812px\">AMZN</td>\n<td style=\"width: 206.188px\">1.510</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 149.812px\">AXP</td>\n<td style=\"width: 206.188px\">1.086</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 149.812px\">BA</td>\n<td style=\"width: 206.188px\">0.992</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 149.812px\">BAC</td>\n<td style=\"width: 206.188px\">0.984</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 149.812px\">BBY</td>\n<td style=\"width: 206.188px\">1.083</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 149.812px\">BKNG</td>\n<td style=\"width: 206.188px\">1.046</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 149.812px\">C</td>\n<td style=\"width: 206.188px\">1.033</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 149.812px\">CAT</td>\n<td style=\"width: 206.188px\">0.861</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 149.812px\">CMCSA</td>\n<td style=\"width: 206.188px\">0.875</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 149.812px\">CMG</td>\n<td style=\"width: 206.188px\">0.875</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 149.812px\">COF</td>\n<td style=\"width: 206.188px\">1.292</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 149.812px\">COP</td>\n<td style=\"width: 206.188px\">0.683</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 149.812px\">COST</td>\n<td style=\"width: 206.188px\">0.840</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 149.812px\">CRM</td>\n<td style=\"width: 206.188px\">1.310</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 149.812px\">CSCO</td>\n<td style=\"width: 206.188px\">0.765</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 149.812px\">CVS</td>\n<td style=\"width: 206.188px\">0.510</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 149.812px\">CVX</td>\n<td style=\"width: 206.188px\">0.644</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 149.812px\">DIS</td>\n<td style=\"width: 206.188px\">1.052</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 149.812px\">EBAY</td>\n<td style=\"width: 206.188px\">1.053</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 149.812px\">META</td>\n<td style=\"width: 206.188px\">1.637</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 149.812px\">FSLR</td>\n<td style=\"width: 206.188px\">1.077</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 149.812px\">GILD</td>\n<td style=\"width: 206.188px\">1.544</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 149.812px\">GM</td>\n<td style=\"width: 206.188px\">1.426</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 149.812px\">GOLD</td>\n<td style=\"width: 206.188px\">0.782</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 149.812px\">GOOGL</td>\n<td style=\"width: 206.188px\">1.260</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 149.812px\">GS</td>\n<td style=\"width: 206.188px\">0.961</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>These values represent the correlation of each security with SPY, giving you a sense of how they move in relation to the S&amp;P 500 ETF (SPY).&nbsp;</p>",
